  "title": "IP geolocation"
 },
 "description": "Locates a public IP address, or a domain resolved to one, at network level: country code, registry, announced prefix, PTR hostname and autonomous systems. Registry-based, so it names the network operator's country, which for hosted or CDN addresses differs from where a visitor or business is located; it is not a street address. Private and reserved addresses have no answer. Anonymous, rate-limited per IP.",
